A '''Winter Rod''' was a {{Rare}} [[Fishing rod|Fishing Rod]] bought during the [[Season of Jerry]] event at [[Sherry|Sherry's]] shop. It required {{skl|fish|10}} to use.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Winter Rod''' could be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Sherry}} for {{c|40k}}.

